  "notes": [
    "Warm-started from frozen v2, never trained from scratch.",
    "Only rl-* tasks supplied PPO rollouts. Existing arenas and Lantern Road authored/flight/fight routes were validation/test for this run; the baseline retains its earlier training history.",
    "Campaign rewards: +1 completion, -2 harness cap/escort loss, -1.5 declared protected companion loss, -1 other defeat; arena loss/cap -1. Authored deadlines are separate from harness caps.",
    "Balanced decision sampling: half arena / half campaign; equal tasks, then variants/opponents/recruiters. Actor minibatch 8, three PPO passes, CPU only.",
